0..49 Comment "//! A well-founded tree has a branching function."
50..53 Comment "//!"
54..95 Comment "//! A node maps each branch to a subtree."
96..150 Comment "//! The family occurs only to the right of that arrow."
151..184 Comment "//! It is thus strictly positive."
185..188 Comment "//!"
189..236 Comment "//! `size` applies the function to each branch."
237..278 Comment "//! It recurses one stage below the node."
279..282 Comment "//!"
283..362 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1982-constructive_mathematics_and_computer_programming]"
363..366 Comment "//!"
